  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v4-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "d1b3ebb1f6b69eafcb4134a749f1698002d35ea2f063f81e5fb0555a38650098",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "da2776977bb59b982fe139a6911b665a3f0ab4ed81ad10dcc913f66f0e822385",
      "text": "悟空的\n摇摇晃晃\n自行车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e5ad2aa59cfa035aba54a3ed2d6a293b8bf6bc7ff301120240b36e931ff8dc36",
      "text": "“看，他们骑得多棒！”\n悟空的尾巴“嘣”地翘起来！\n“我也想骑！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e86717e3df28ade030ac94ae050f449cb2a167900f030cea1b7ae06f68ef974",
      "text": "悟空戴上头盔。\n“准备好啦！”\n“嗯……戴反了！”\n悟空咯咯笑。\n“再试一次！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e5d4fe8a8ddc0c7d8c79e498ce390eb03c2b315b6b385901ecd8bcf27845531",
      "text": "他用脚蹬地。\n嗖，嗖，嗖。\n“看！小猴滑板车！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4bb602d4259b7f2fe9908bf3f332286330a145dd2b5217966fe351f4ec1b514f",
      "text": "脚抬起来……\n摇呀！晃呀！\n扑通！\n“你好呀，小草。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3a9f171a83d57741733637e838ad8e4e033e27eb2542c1beb53546c9dd7fbe89",
      "text": "“按按铃，也许就不晃啦。”\n叮铃！叮铃！\n铃铛倒是响了，\n车子还是晃呀晃。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9df82a94fe26d7e2a110a2883c8322fa4a9d91f67ee5bb8c073da5d8df48ffbe",
      "text": "八戒扶住车座。\n“眼睛看前面，慢慢来。”\n玉兔在旁边喊：\n“你能行！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aaddee281c2c80406f95f6daa4dedbe6552d67b10a11ec3401bb2d81bd715cd9",
      "text": "悟空又试了一次。\n蹬地，出发！\n踩一下脚踏板，\n再踩一下。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "077b1689c67f7500891a11874baff1ea3c0ecbf22a4beff12e77cbec88d89b13",
      "text": "他往左边晃，\n尾巴往右边晃。\n“我的尾巴也在学呢！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "269952bcc6cd7ed778c65068fb3fd62bc1f89685b1b7f67f9cda84ae674c3e6e",
      "text": "他每天都练一会儿。\n有时只能骑一小段，\n有时还是晃呀晃。\n他每天都再试一试。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a3cd95828d5d7cdd15c1e74263966d6834aa16c18a3cbb6a404c7ae0caec2ce",
      "text": "有一天傍晚……\n八戒松开了手。\n悟空还在往前骑！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "919573a09ffa92b34716775faa362708f72dfdcd3b1be3c944bc5bc19ac2e400",
      "text": "“我会骑啦！”\n他的围巾飘呀飘，\n尾巴绕了个圈。\n连耳朵都觉得好骄傲。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "36354d5d9ba780bf0a423026af672692e208ca1a703d4ae9eba0853b63477845",
      "text": "他学会了转弯，\n也学会了停车——\n就停在水坑前。\n“小鸭子，你先走。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a007a834e59a5769c850ed2f63634afd2f493d32166fe9e8819541987dfdd1d4",
      "text": "现在，他们一起骑车。\n不着急，\n轮子开开心心地转。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "05264b189bb854d9da1d0dca52aa335ac149257169ca8c5c9b934ce46e9bcc29",
      "text": "回到家，他停好自行车。\n“晚安，轮子。”\n“晚安，摇摇晃晃。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4434d3caa7faff97329d94c813734e13e57f1d5e8c5cf7dab837bfa53873bfaa",
      "text": "悟空在床上蜷成一团。\n梦里的小路平平整整，\n轮子轻轻地说：\n“嘘……”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
